## 1. Executive Summary

This profiling report presents the quantitative and structural baseline of all six source data files provided for the CityLinc Nashik AI Calling Agent. The data assets encompass public transit routes, stop sequences, station coordinates, timetable departure schedules, fleet vehicles, and fare pass schemes.

The audit was conducted strictly non-destructively. Every record count, column profile, distinct cardinality, null distribution, and cross-dataset relation was computed directly from raw sources without modifying, sanitizing, or dropping any underlying records.

